# Documentation

- Write all user documentation in simple B2 English.
- Reflect every Makefile or Compose interface change in `README.md` and `docs/`.
- Keep examples copy-paste ready.
- Do not document commands that do not exist.
- Clearly mark Docker socket risk with a warning.
- Prefer MkDocs Material admonitions (`note`, `tip`, `warning`, `info`).
- Avoid duplicating the same long explanation across many pages; link instead.
